notes.content:
In this update you will find:

[list]
[*] Chinese localization, thanks to Xiangzhe Zhao;
[*] Spanish LA localization, thanks to Jared Téllez;
[*] When loading level from menu it always starts from the motel now. Checkpoints are only for returning to them during the game now, many players found starting from checkpoints confusing, especially after some time without playing the game;
[*] Zooming is stronger now, so it should be easier to read map and other texts in the world space;
[*] End Credits problems with Cyrillic fonts should be fixed now. 
[/list]

And thanks again to all of you - there is more than 9000 Titan Chaser players at the moment and almost 200 Very Positive reviews, I'm happy so many people dig my creation!

Cheers,
Stas
